#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:20002
#: 4245084eaec948f49ff6cb745157237d
msgid "Noise Budgeting and Multi-Channel Correlation Analysis"
msgstr "ノイズバジェッティングと多チャンネル相関解析"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:20004
#: 98c773f04eff456a92bf86fbe5f51d18
msgid ""
"In precision measurements (such as gravitational wave detectors), "
"identifying the origin of noise contained in the main observation data is"
" extremely important. This process is called **Noise Budgeting**."
msgstr ""
"精密計測（重力波検出器など）において、メインの観測データに含まれる雑音が「何に由来するのか」を特定することは極めて重要です。このプロセスを "
"**Noise Budgeting（ノイズバジェッティング）** と呼びます。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:20006
#: 950dfb7bb5c5493695271db30fa30ea6
msgid ""
"The sensitivity curve of a gravitational wave detector is limited by "
"ground vibrations at low frequencies, thermal noise at mid frequencies, "
"and statistical noise (shot noise) at high frequencies, exhibiting a "
"characteristic \"U-shaped\" profile."
msgstr "重力波検出器の感度曲線は、低周波では地面振動、中周波では熱雑音、高周波では統計的なノイズ（ショットノイズ）によって制限され、特徴的な「下に凸」の形状を示します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:20008
#: 64f7902eb327445fb5fe2700b3529ca8
msgid ""
"In this tutorial, we will demonstrate the analysis with the following "
"flow:"
msgstr "このチュートリアルでは、以下の流れで解析を実演します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:20010
#: 97d975c0ebab4863a8030f94aebc42a5
msgid ""
"**Multi-Channel Data Simulation**: In addition to the main channel, we "
"generate auxiliary channels for ground vibrations, magnetic field "
"fluctuations, circuit noise, etc."
msgstr "**多チャンネルデータのシミュレーション**: メインチャンネルに加え、地面振動、磁場変動、回路ノイズなどの補助チャンネルを生成します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:20011
#: 44722aad0cd249309411b2ddbc421ba5
msgid ""
"**Coherence Mapping**: Calculate the coherence between the main channel "
"and each auxiliary channel to identify the primary noise sources."
msgstr "**相関解析 (Coherence Mapping)**: メインチャンネルと各補助チャンネルのコヒーレンスを計算し、主なノイズ源を特定します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:20012
#: f69f4aec65bd46e08d808dfbda5efb11
msgid ""
"**Transfer Function Estimation**: Estimate the \"coupling strength "
"(transfer function)\" from the auxiliary channels to the main channel."
msgstr "**結合関数の推定 (Transfer Function)**: 補助チャンネルからメインへの「漏れ込み量（伝達関数）」を推定します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:20013
#: f976ad076568464d8425efb36bb84d94
msgid ""
"**Noise Projection**: Using the transfer function, convert (project) the "
"noise from the auxiliary channels into the units of the main channel."
msgstr "**ノイズ投影 (Noise Projection)**: 伝達関数を用いて、補助チャンネルのノイズをメインチャンネルの単位に変換（投影）します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:20014
#: 842e1f58a0954eb989d5b4c5974a3099
msgid ""
"**Noise Budget Visualization (Noise Budget Plot)**: Overlay all noise "
"sources to reveal the breakdown of the observed \"U-shaped\" spectrum."
msgstr ""
"**ノイズ予算の可視化 (Noise Budget Plot)**: "
"すべてのノイズ源を重ね合わせ、観測された「U字型」スペクトルの内訳を明らかにします。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:40002
#: 1262bc575f464de2a193d4dc00f68b21
msgid "1. Multi-Channel Data Simulation (Creating a U-Shaped Spectrum)"
msgstr "1\\. 多チャンネルデータのシミュレーション (U字型スペクトルの作成)"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:40004
#: a632a664e15d4a46aac684ebb655d4d7
msgid "We create a sensitivity curve that mimics a gravitational wave detector."
msgstr "重力波検出器を模した感度曲線を作成します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:40005
#: 1cb51496981c42ee90554b956315c13a
msgid ""
"`MAIN`: The observation target. Has a \"U-shaped\" spectrum dominated by "
"ground vibrations in the low-frequency region and actuator/circuit system"
" noise in the high-frequency region."
msgstr "`MAIN`: 観測対象。低域で地面振動、高域でアクチュエータ/回路系のノイズが支配的な「下に凸」のスペクトルを持ちます。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:40006
#: f21b1d65d984474e9aa01cf871c6b586
msgid "`AUX_SEIS`: Monitors low-frequency ground vibrations."
msgstr "`AUX_SEIS`: 低周波の地面振動をモニター。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:40007
#: ed6147b7fd7446a08c16af8afa938874
msgid "`AUX_MAG`: Magnetic field monitor (including 60Hz power line)."
msgstr "`AUX_MAG`: 磁場モニター（60Hzの電源ラインを含む）。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:40008
#: 1330c719f300412d96e4dfc777ce8bfe
msgid ""
"`AUX_ELEC`: High-frequency noise source (e.g., control system or readout "
"circuit noise)."
msgstr "`AUX_ELEC`: 高周波側のノイズ源（例：制御システムや読み出し回路のノイズ）。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:60002
#: d49e929c0f48499e8db3a5043a77cf05
msgid "2. Coherence Mapping"
msgstr "2\\. 相関解析 (Coherence Mapping)"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:60004
#: 94a9441209834c908b4e93a5b6e5d03b
msgid ""
"We check which sensors have high coherence (magnitude-squared coherence "
"$\\gamma^2$, see [Physics Models: "
"Coherence](../../explanation/physics_models.md)) with the left side, "
"bottom, and right side of the \"U-shape\" of the main channel."
msgstr ""
"メインチャンネルの「U字」の左側、底、右側で、それぞれどのセンサーと高い二乗コヒーレンス（$\\gamma^2$、"
"[物理モデル: コヒーレンス](../../explanation/physics_models.md) 参照）を持っているかを確認します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:80002
#: 3f888fdf8a1449d494631bf421da9264
msgid "3. Transfer Function Estimation"
msgstr "3\\. 結合関数の推定"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:80004
#: f39d645c71a1450c943cb3033577da31
msgid ""
"We estimate the coupling coefficients (transfer functions) in each "
"frequency band."
msgstr "各帯域における漏れ込み係数（伝達関数）を推定します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:80006
#: 0a29e6a5d5d84c399d913accf5d85eb8
msgid ""
"`witness.transfer_function(MAIN)` estimates the numerical output/input "
"ratio using the native channel values. Its GWpy-compatible result is "
"dimensionless. We explicitly attach `MAIN.unit / witness.unit` before "
"multiplying by the witness ASD; every projected contribution then has "
"MAIN amplitude per square root hertz. The estimation and ASD use the same"
" segment length, overlap, and Hann window."
msgstr ""
"`witness.transfer_function(MAIN)` は、各チャンネルの値を使って出力と入力の数値的な比を推定します。GWpy "
"と互換の結果は無次元です。補助チャンネルの ASD を掛ける前に `MAIN.unit / witness.unit` "
"を明示的に付与することで、推定した各寄与の単位が MAIN の振幅単位/√Hz になります。伝達関数の推定と ASD "
"には、同じ区間長、オーバーラップ、Hann 窓を使います。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:80008
#: da805ab4395d4417a8f1aab7abb717de
msgid ""
"Quadrature addition assumes independent noise sources. Shared witness "
"noise can be counted more than once, and a finite-data estimate need not "
"lie below the observed ASD in every frequency bin. Use the [Wiener "
"filtering case study](case_wiener_filter.ipynb) for correlated witnesses."
msgstr ""
"二乗和平方根による合成は、ノイズ源の独立性を仮定します。補助チャンネル間で共通するノイズは重複して数えられる場合があります。また、有限長のデータからの推定値が、すべての周波数ビンで観測"
" ASD を下回るとは限りません。相関のある補助チャンネルを扱う場合は、[Wiener "
"フィルタのケーススタディ](case_wiener_filter.ipynb)を参照してください。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:100002
#: 84aff93aa7164e1084b4a8db1bf81bd9
msgid "4. Noise Projection"
msgstr "4\\. ノイズ投影 (Noise Projection)"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:120002
#: 3e1d85d433d745e7846291e859fa2e08
msgid "5. Noise Budget Visualization (Noise Budget Plot)"
msgstr "5\\. ノイズ予算の可視化 (Noise Budget Plot)"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:120004
#: ff3a43a6279a424d820b52a40faa2838
msgid ""
"We display how the \"U-shaped\" noise of the main channel is explained "
"and decomposed."
msgstr "「下に凸」のメインチャンネルのノイズが、どのように解説・分解されるかを表示します。"

